  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SHARK_MARINE_PRODUCTS_INDUSTRY_DESCRIPTION",         "{1_CityName}渔民把鲨鱼皮晒干，用来打磨木器，或者做成坚韧的皮革。"),
  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SHARK_MARINE_PRODUCTS_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",      "{1_CityName}鱼翅曾是[文明名]高级宴席的排面，如今已被可持续的仿翅取代。"),
