  ("zh_Hans_CN",  "LOC_HD_RESOURCE_SUK_SHARK_MEDICINE_CORPORATION_DESCRIPTION",             "{1_CityName}鲨鱼软骨素和角鲨烯制品，是[文明名]关节养护和护肤品的尖端原料。"),

